  "solve_provenance_note": "Offline development-twin route RESTRUCTURING of an ALREADY-banked route (lf52 was already 10/10 in the registry; this does NOT bank a new level). The public game source (environment_files/lf52/271a04aa/lf52.py) was read to recover the L9 camera model -- explicitly PERMITTED for PUBLIC-game offline dev per CLAUDE.md 'ARC Live-Path Reachability Discipline' (source-reading is a public-games dev tool, forbidden only in the hidden live submission). This is not a live_agent_self_discovery claim and not a new solve; it makes the existing offline-verified depth genuinely live-submittable.",
  "random_seed": null,
  "random_seed_note": "Deterministic pipeline: the constrained best-first search over the faithful pure-Python L9 model, the offline-arcade replay, and the live replay are all deterministic given the fixed board; no RNG is invoked.",
