  "novel_mechanics_found": [
    "L9 render pixel = 6*grid + world_offset; world_offset starts -15 after the scripted (6,5) pan.",
    "Scripted -20px world pan on ANY peg landing at cell (6,5) (fires every time, not just once).",
    "Carrier-follow pan of (-dx*6,0) per ACTION1-4 move ONLY when a green (name 'fozwvlovdui', not blue) rides the carrier; empty/blue carrier does not pan.",
    "Carrier rail is row y=5, x=6-20, so the carried green is a controllable 'camera crane' spanning the whole east chamber.",
    "Blue pegs (fozwvlovdui_blue) are indestructible relays: never removed, never the removal target; only green-over-green same-name jumps reduce the win count."
  ],
